    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηρ-άσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
